Z||000005||Jefrysuko||12-09-2001||09:49 PM||||Well at least now you know what your problem is.  Daniel is a good guy I need to get him to come by and help me with some of my projects!  Try all the local auto parts stores for a new master cyl. also <A HREF="http://www.gmpartsdirect.com" TARGET=_blank>www.gmpartsdirect.com</A>   There are two different styles and I am not sure which one you should use now that you have upgraded the pedal.  If you need a hand bleeding it again I will be in the area sometime for the holidays so let me know.<P>Hope this is a start to better things for you.||||reg||1
Z||000006||TRiAD||12-09-2001||09:54 PM||||Thanks Jefry, me, too...<BR>For a moment, we thought we <I>might</I> have her on the road tonight...<P>Let me know when you're going to be in town, we should get together whether you have time to help with a bleed or not...<P>Have a good one!<BR>||||reg||1
